35,2,1,talk,Kenji,,The complaint log shows one house filed most complaints. That explains the tension.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shizue,,The station block's minutes show they argued about sweeping. A bin house isn't magic.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Asuka,,The truck comes at 7:40. A narrow window means waking up very early.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Rin,,The frontages are uneven. One is very narrow. A permanent build might not fit.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,"The subsidy covers only 40%. The ledger shows 34,000 yen in yearly waste costs.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Servas, that yearly cost is high. It adds to the burden.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Asuka, waking up early is hard. I don't want to impose that on anyone.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, if the space is uneven, a rotating location might be the only fair option.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, yes. But moving it every month is a lot of work.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Kenji, the complaints suggest we need a system that feels fair to all.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"If we rotate, everyone shares the inconvenience. That might help us talk.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"Rotating sounds tiring, but perhaps it prevents one person from suffering alone.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Asuka,,The supervised mornings take 50 minutes. That's manageable if we rotate.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Rin,,I like the idea of sharing the load. It feels more equal.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Servas,,A rotating system spreads the cost and the effort. It seems wise.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Kenji,,I think rotating is the best way to keep the peace.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"I agree. It is a shared burden, which is a shared strength.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Asuka,,The hours are acceptable. I can live with a rotation.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Rin,,Yes! Let's move the bin. It's fair and fun.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Servas,,Let us adopt the rotation. It balances the scales of our small community.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
